OL,3,AKing Haakon VIII takes the throne in
OL,4,ANorway following death of Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlowers are being laid at a memorial
OL,7,Fnear the palace, and the UK's King
OL,8,FCharles III shares his "most heartfelt
OL,9,Fcondolences"
OL,11,FKing Haakon has met with government
OL,12,Fministers at the Royal Palace in the
OL,13,Fcapital - he was seen wearing black
OL,14,Fmilitary regalia and arrived in an Audi
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
